        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "对于 introduces the target of an attitude or the topic being considered. Keep the following judgment relevant to that target.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "对于这件事，我没有意见。",
                "pinyin": "duìyú zhè jiàn shì ， wǒ méiyǒu yìjiàn 。",
                "meaning": "I have no objection concerning this matter.",
